{"seq":1,"slug":"job-status-progress-query","title":"任务状态与进度查询 API","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/merchant-bulk-async-job-api/status-result-callback/job-status-progress-query","wordCount":1919,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"任务状态与进度查询-api\">任务状态与进度查询 API</h1><p>调用方提交任务后拿到的只是一个字符串。在任务运行的几分钟到几小时里，这个接口是它唯一能获得信息的通道。设计得好的状态接口能让调用方写出简单可靠的集成；设计得差的接口会诱导调用方做出「每秒查一次、看 <code>progress</code> 百分比变化就以为一切正常」这种判断，而进度百分比恰恰是最容易误导人的字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>状态查询接口必须同时服务三类消费者，且它们的诉求不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消费者</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>调用频率</th>\n<th>对响应的要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>调用方业务代码</td>\n<td>终态与结果位置</td>\n<td>低（分钟级）</td>\n<td>字段稳定、语义明确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调用方运营界面</td>\n<td>进度与剩余时间</td>\n<td>高（秒级）</td>\n<td>响应快、数字单调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台自身运维</td>\n<td>内部状态与异常</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>能定位卡点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个接口同时满足三者是可行的，前提是把「对外状态」与「内部状态」分离（见 <a href=\"../async-job-model/job-schema-lifecycle\">任务 schema 与生命周期状态机</a>），并让进度字段满足单调性这个强约束。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  C[调用方] --&gt; A[&quot;GET /v1/bulk-jobs/{job_no}&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; R1[任务记录主表]&#10;  A --&gt; R2[进度快照缓存]&#10;  A --&gt; R3[结果文件元信息]&#10;  R1 --&gt; S[组装响应]&#10;  R2 --&gt; S&#10;  R3 --&gt; S&#10;  S --&gt; C\">graph TD\n  C[调用方] --&gt; A[\"GET /v1/bulk-jobs/{job_no}\"]\n  A --&gt; R1[任务记录主表]\n  A --&gt; R2[进度快照缓存]\n  A --&gt; R3[结果文件元信息]\n  R1 --&gt; S[组装响应]\n  R2 --&gt; S\n  R3 --&gt; S\n  S --&gt; C</pre><p>三个数据源分别对应「权威状态」「低成本进度」「结果交付」。分开的理由是它们的更新频率与读取频率差异巨大：状态几乎不变但每次都要读，进度每秒都变但只在轮询时读，结果文件元信息只在终态后才有值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"响应契约\">响应契约</h2><h3 id=\"字段设计\">字段设计</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;job_no&quot;: &quot;bj_7f3c9a21&quot;,&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;RUNNING&quot;,&#10;  &quot;job_type&quot;: &quot;PRICE_UPDATE&quot;,&#10;  &quot;progress&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;total&quot;: 42310,&#10;    &quot;processed&quot;: 18744,&#10;    &quot;succeeded&quot;: 18602,&#10;    &quot;failed&quot;: 128,&#10;    &quot;skipped&quot;: 14,&#10;    &quot;percent&quot;: 44.3&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;shards&quot;: { &quot;total&quot;: 64, &quot;done&quot;: 27 },&#10;  &quot;submitted_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T02:14:07Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;started_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T02:14:09Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;finished_at&quot;: null,&#10;  &quot;deadline_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T03:14:07Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;result&quot;: null,&#10;  &quot;error&quot;: null&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"job_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bj_7f3c9a21\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RUNNING\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"job_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PRICE_UPDATE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"progress\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42310</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"processed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18744</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"succeeded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18602</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"failed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"skipped\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"percent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">44.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"shards\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"done\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">27</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"submitted_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T02:14:07Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"started_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T02:14:09Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"finished_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"deadline_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T03:14:07Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>终态后 <code>result</code> 有值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;PARTIALLY_SUCCEEDED&quot;,&#10;  &quot;finished_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T02:31:52Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;result&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;succeeded_count&quot;: 41988,&#10;    &quot;failed_count&quot;: 322,&#10;    &quot;error_summary&quot;: { &quot;SKU_OFF_SHELF&quot;: 281, &quot;PRICE_BELOW_COST&quot;: 41 },&#10;    &quot;success_file_url&quot;: &quot;https://files.example.com/r/…?sig=…&quot;,&#10;    &quot;error_file_url&quot;: &quot;https://files.example.com/e/…?sig=…&quot;,&#10;    &quot;expires_at&quot;: &quot;2026-10-04T02:31:52Z&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;error&quot;: null&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PARTIALLY_SUCCEEDED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"finished_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T02:31:52Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"succeeded_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">41988</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"failed_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">322</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"error_summary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"SKU_OFF_SHELF\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">281</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"PRICE_BELOW_COST\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">41</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"success_file_url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://files.example.com/r/…?sig=…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"error_file_url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://files.example.com/e/…?sig=…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"expires_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-04T02:31:52Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>失败任务用 <code>error</code> 而不是 <code>result</code>，两者互斥：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;FAILED&quot;,&#10;  &quot;error&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;code&quot;: &quot;UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE&quot;,&#10;    &quot;message&quot;: &quot;pricing service returned 503 for 3 consecutive shards&quot;,&#10;    &quot;retryable&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FAILED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pricing service returned 503 for 3 consecutive shards\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"retryable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"字段语义的硬约束\">字段语义的硬约束</h3><p>三个约束必须写进接口文档并在实现中强制：</p>\n<p>第一，<code>processed = succeeded + failed + skipped</code> 恒成立。这个等式让调用方能自己核对数字，也能在平台实现有 bug 时立刻发现。</p>\n<p>第二，<code>processed</code> 单调不减。分片重试时，已成功的行被跳过会<strong>增加</strong> <code>skipped</code>，不会减少 <code>processed</code>。若重试导致某行从 <code>FAILED</code> 变成 <code>SUCCEEDED</code>，<code>succeeded</code> 与 <code>failed</code> 会此消彼长，但 <code>processed</code> 不变。</p>\n<p>第三，<code>percent</code> 由 <code>processed / total</code> 派生，不由平台独立维护。独立维护的百分比必然与计数漂移，而调用方会同时看到两者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"进度的产生方式\">进度的产生方式</h2><h3 id=\"实时累加-vs-反算\">实时累加 vs 反算</h3><p>进度数字有两种产生方式，各有代价：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>读取成本</th>\n<th>准确性</th>\n<th>写入成本</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>worker 实时累加</td>\n<td>极低（读一行）</td>\n<td>有漂移风险，重试时需补偿</td>\n<td>每批一次 UPDATE</td>\n<td>高轮询频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果表聚合反算</td>\n<td>高（扫结果表或索引）</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>无额外写入</td>\n<td>低频查询、终态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分片计数求和</td>\n<td>低（64 行）</td>\n<td>精确（若分片计数精确）</td>\n<td>每分片终结一次</td>\n<td>折中，推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定时快照</td>\n<td>极低（读缓存）</td>\n<td>秒级延迟</td>\n<td>定时任务成本</td>\n<td>高频轮询 + 大任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>分片计数求和</strong>是推荐方案：分片表只有几十到几千行，按 <code>job_id</code> 聚合一次的成本可接受，且分片计数本身就是由结果表反算的（见 <a href=\"../job-execution/row-idempotent-partial\">行级幂等与部分成功</a>），所以精确性有保证。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT COALESCE(sum(total_count), 0)     AS total,&#10;       COALESCE(sum(processed_count), 0) AS processed,&#10;       COALESCE(sum(succeeded_count), 0) AS succeeded,&#10;       COALESCE(sum(failed_count), 0)    AS failed,&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE status IN (&#39;SUCCEEDED&#39;,&#39;FAILED&#39;,&#39;CANCELED&#39;)) AS done,&#10;       count(*)                          AS shard_total&#10;  FROM bulk_job_shards&#10; WHERE job_id = $1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total_count), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(processed_count), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> processed,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(succeeded_count), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> succeeded,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(failed_count), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> failed,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SUCCEEDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FAILED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CANCELED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> done,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shard_total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bulk_job_shards</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> job_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>若分片数上万（大任务把分片切得很细），这个聚合会变慢，此时改用<strong>定时快照</strong>：后台每 5 秒把聚合结果写入任务表的一个 JSONB 列，查询接口直接读该列。代价是进度有最多 5 秒延迟，这对轮询场景完全可以接受。</p>\n<h3 id=\"剩余时间估算\">剩余时间估算</h3><p>调用方运营界面最想要的是「还要多久」。这个估算极易做错：用 <code>已用时间 / 已处理行数 × 剩余行数</code> 得出的数字在任务初期极不稳定（前 100 行可能有缓存冷启动的开销），在任务后期又会因为长尾分片而严重低估。</p>\n<p>更稳的做法是基于<strong>分片完成速率</strong>而非行速率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>S</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{remain} \\approx \\frac{S_{total} - S_{done}}{\\dot{S}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">main</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1705em;vertical-align:-0.8102em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1898em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8102em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>S</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是最近 60 秒的分片完成速率。分片完成速率比行速率稳定，因为分片粒度已经被设计成接近等时长（见 <a href=\"../async-job-model/job-shard-chunk\">任务分片与分块提交</a>）。</p>\n<p>即使如此，这个估算仍应作为<strong>可选字段</strong>并标注不确定性，而不是核心契约。平台不应该为估算错误承担契约责任。</p>\n<h2 id=\"查询频率与限流\">查询频率与限流</h2><h3 id=\"轮询建议\">轮询建议</h3><p>接口文档应当明确给出轮询建议，否则调用方常见行为是每秒一次，在大批量集成场景下形成可观的无效负载。</p>\n<p>推荐阶梯：任务提交后 30 秒内每 5 秒一次，30 秒到 5 分钟之间每 15 秒一次，之后每 60 秒一次。这个阶梯的依据是任务时长分布——多数小任务在前 30 秒完成，长任务的变化速率在后期趋缓。</p>\n<p>更好的建议是让调用方<strong>优先使用完成回调</strong>，只在回调不可达时降级为轮询。回调的存在使得轮询可以退化为「粗粒度兜底」，见 <a href=\"completion-callback-webhook\">完成回调（webhook）与重试</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"轮询超限的响应\">轮询超限的响应</h3><p>当调用方的轮询频率超过配额时，返回 429 而不是静默降级。RFC 6585 对 429 的定义是「用户在给定时间内发送了过多请求」，且响应「应当包含解释该状况的细节」，并「可以包含一个 <code>Retry-After</code> 头，指示在发起新请求前应当等待多久」（<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6585.html\">RFC 6585</a>）。</p>\n<p>批量任务的 429 响应体建议用 <code>application/problem+json</code>，携带结构化的错误信息。RFC 9457 定义了这个格式的五个成员：<code>type</code>（标识问题类型的 URI 引用）、<code>title</code>（人类可读的简短摘要）、<code>status</code>（HTTP 状态码）、<code>detail</code>（针对此次出现的可读解释）、<code>instance</code>（标识此次具体出现的 URI 引用）（<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9457.html\">RFC 9457</a>）。用标准格式的好处是调用方可以用一个通用的错误处理层解析所有平台的错误，而不必为每个接口写特例。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;https://api.example.com/problems/poll-rate-exceeded&quot;,&#10;  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Poll rate exceeded&quot;,&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: 429,&#10;  &quot;detail&quot;: &quot;Job status polling for tenant 4821 exceeded 20 req/min; retry after 12s&quot;,&#10;  &quot;instance&quot;: &quot;/v1/bulk-jobs/bj_7f3c9a21&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.example.com/problems/poll-rate-exceeded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Poll rate exceeded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">429</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"detail\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Job status polling for tenant 4821 exceeded 20 req/min; retry after 12s\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"instance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/v1/bulk-jobs/bj_7f3c9a21\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"查询接口与列表接口\">查询接口与列表接口</h2><p>除了单任务查询，调用方还需要<strong>列出自己的任务</strong>并筛选。列表接口的设计要点是：</p>\n<p>筛选维度必须包含状态与时间范围。调用方最常见的需求是「我有哪些还在跑的任务」和「昨天有哪些失败了」。前者用 <code>status IN (&#39;PENDING&#39;,&#39;RUNNING&#39;)</code>，后者用 <code>submitted_at &gt;= …</code> 加 <code>status = &#39;FAILED&#39;</code>。</p>\n<p>分页用游标而非偏移量。任务表持续增长，<code>OFFSET 10000</code> 会随着表增长而变慢，且在并发提交时会产生遗漏或重复。游标用 <code>(submitted_at, id)</code> 组合，保证稳定。</p>\n<p>排序默认按提交时间倒序，但要允许按状态筛选后按提交时间正序——排查积压时需要看最老的未完成任务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>状态查询接口同时服务业务代码、运营界面与平台运维三类消费者，靠分离「对外状态」与「内部状态」来同时满足。</li>\n<li>响应拆成状态、进度、分片计数、结果、错误五个部分；<code>result</code> 与 <code>error</code> 互斥。</li>\n<li>三条硬约束必须写进文档并强制实现：<code>processed = succeeded + failed + skipped</code>；<code>processed</code> 单调不减；<code>percent</code> 由计数派生而非独立维护。</li>\n<li>进度产生方式按规模选：分片计数求和是默认推荐，分片数上万时改用定时快照。</li>\n<li>剩余时间应基于分片完成速率而非行速率，且作为可选字段标注不确定性，不承担契约责任。</li>\n<li>接口文档必须给出轮询阶梯建议，并引导调用方优先使用完成回调。</li>\n<li>轮询超限返回 429 加 <code>Retry-After</code>；错误体用 <code>application/problem+json</code>（RFC 9457 的五个成员），让调用方有统一的错误处理层。</li>\n<li>列表接口按状态与时间筛选，分页用 <code>(submitted_at, id)</code> 游标而非偏移量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>查询接口能返回聚合计数，但几十万条失败明细不能塞进响应体——见 <a href=\"result-file-error-detail\">结果文件与逐行错误明细</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"任务状态与进度查询 API","id":"任务状态与进度查询-api"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"响应契约","id":"响应契约"},{"level":3,"text":"字段设计","id":"字段设计"},{"level":3,"text":"字段语义的硬约束","id":"字段语义的硬约束"},{"level":2,"text":"进度的产生方式","id":"进度的产生方式"},{"level":3,"text":"实时累加 vs 反算","id":"实时累加-vs-反算"},{"level":3,"text":"剩余时间估算","id":"剩余时间估算"},{"level":2,"text":"查询频率与限流","id":"查询频率与限流"},{"level":3,"text":"轮询建议","id":"轮询建议"},{"level":3,"text":"轮询超限的响应","id":"轮询超限的响应"},{"level":2,"text":"查询接口与列表接口","id":"查询接口与列表接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"租户/大任务资源隔离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/merchant-bulk-async-job-api/job-execution/tenant-resource-isolation"},"next":{"title":"结果文件与逐行错误明细","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/merchant-bulk-async-job-api/status-result-callback/result-file-error-detail"}}